    "name": "Kaleyra CPaaS Messages Voice API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Kaleyra (a Tata Communications company) omnichannel CPaaS REST API for SMS, WhatsApp, RCS, Voice, and Verify (OTP), plus the Kaleyra Video REST API. Requests authenticate with the `api-key` header and address an account by its SID in the URL path. Regional hosts serve India, APAC/SEA, and EU data residency.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Kaleyra Support",
